  (text "ADC2 and CSA share DRV_AVDD: ratiometric reference; both analog/digital ADC supplies turn off with the driver.\nCH3-7 are grounded through removable 0R links; CH3 bus-current sensing is not populated."
    (at 20 33 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "97c9129e-f300-5233-b6fb-22520732fdf2"))
  (text "MA735 supply follows HALL_EN; QOD discharges ENC_3V3.\nAbsolute SPI only; unused outputs NC, TEST/SSCK grounded.\nStart with 64us filter window; high-resolution 16ms filtering\nis unsuitable for the proposed fast wheel feedback loop."
    (at 219 123 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.05 1.05))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "de46fed7-1e2c-595c-8f0f-2e6a344b4d79"))
  (text "SOx = AVDD/2 +/- gain * I. Initial gain target 1.2 V/A; calibrate zero and gain. 330R/22pF: fc = 21.9MHz.\nMultiplexed samples are not simultaneous. Prove common low-side window, settling, launch jitter and angle age."
    (at 20 273 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "f4e7a449-950d-5c13-be5b-23e71d1950e3"))
